                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1098a616-3e78-4525-be02-92d6d16e4bb3",
                                                "sense_id": "10186589-8315-3d64-914e-281e8e752ed7",
                                                "text": "The maker of film commercials should be especially aware of the film standards published by the networks and adhere to them carefully, as the effectiveness of his commercial is greatly affected by its adjacencies. He may well give serious thought in his production planning to the problem caused by adjacent film which, in most cases, will not be under his control."
